    "text": "A large drum having radius $R$ is spinning around its axis with angular velocity $\\omega$, as shown in figure. The minimum value of $\\omega$ so that a body of mass $M$ remains stuck to the inner wall of the drum, taking the coefficient of friction between the drum surface and mass $M$ as $\\mu$, is : <br> <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main_2026_watermark/21S2_q_43_1.jpg\">",
    "image": null
